    "description": "Comprehensive Postman test suite for restful-booker.herokuapp.com.\n\nCovers /auth, /booking, /booking/:id, /ping.\nPositive + negative cases. Known bugs marked inside tests.\n\nDefault admin credentials: admin / password123",
